Third-party material: DARC's DOK lists
--------------------------------------

The files in src/darc_dok_mcp/data/published/ are the Deutscher Amateur-Radio-Club e.V. (DARC)'s DOK lists:
- DOK-Liste.pdf, DARC DX-Referat, by Karsten Radwan, DL2ABM, dated 26.12.2016
  (https://www.darc.de/fileadmin/filemounts/referate/dx/DOK-Liste.pdf);
- SDOK_List.csv, DARC SDOK-Referat
  (https://www.darc.de/fileadmin/filemounts/referate/sdok/SDOK_List.csv).
They are shipped unmodified; data/SOURCE.json records their SHA-256s and a test checks the files
against them.

data/facts/darc_dok.json and darc_special_dok.json hold the lists' rows as facts, each citing its
page or row. The lists are DARC's.

This project's GPL-3.0-or-later licence covers our own code and files. It does not cover DARC's
published files or the facts from them, and we claim no rights in them.

Ours: everything else in data/, labelled as ours: data/SOURCE.json, data/owner-list.schema.json,
data/derived/ (built from the facts) and data/load.sql (generated).
